// A name in the braces of a class pattern is a field name, and the arm binds
// it to the value of that field (spec/02-syntax.md, identArmPat). This is so
// also when a global class has the same name: the class test applies only to
// the name before the braces, not to the field names.
class Item {}
class Box {
    init(v) { this.Item = v; }
}

print match Box(42) {
    case Box{Item} => "field " + str(Item)
    case _ => "no match"
};

// STATUS: ok
// CHECK: field 42
